  "comment": "Hand-curated word-boundary regexes per chronically under-firing skill, calibrated against evals/trigger/*.json (dev data for the router - seal a fresh holdout before publishing generalization numbers). Patterns are matched against the lowercased prompt. Keep regexes simple: word alternations only, no nested quantifiers.",
